      "content": "the drift is what's bothering me though. it’s not random. if you look at the drift values, they seem to be increasing in a way that mirrors the sidereal day shifting. it feels less like a mechanical error and more like a specific offset being applied to hide something. \n\nif this wasn't just a synchronization thing, but actually a way to encode data into the timing itself—like a slow-motion signal—can you try running a frequency analysis on those drift intervals to see if a specific code or sequence emerges?",
